  "details": "- Fix CVE-2026-71199: reject unkeyed checksums in CAMMAC verifiers\n- Fix CVE-2026-71200: prevent null dereference in PKINIT CMS processing\n- Fix CVE-2026-112320: release RPCSEC_GSS context when a client switches auth flavor\n- Fix CVE-2026-112314: free RPC reply verifier between clnttcp_call() retries\n- Fix CVE-2026-112321: free AUTH_GSSAPI call arguments on all exit paths\n- Fix CVE-2026-107364: prevent KDC read overrun in fetch_asn1_field()\n- Fix CVE-2026-112322 CVE-2026-112323: disable the AUTH_GSSAPI RPC flavor unless GSSRPC_ALLOW_AUTH_GSSAPI is set\n- Fix CVE-2026-118380: use the verified RPCSEC_GSS service level for each call\n- Fix CVE-2026-119079: avoid quadratic reallocation when decoding ASN.1 sequences",
